<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Lever Brothers Q1 profits lower.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Lever Brothers Q1 profits lower.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter result of Nigerian conglomerate Lever Brothers Plc to end-March 1997, published on Monday. (In million naira)</p>
<p>				    1997	  1996</p>
<p>Turnover			  1,900 vs 2,000</p>
<p>Profit before taxation	  388 vs 394</p>
<p>Taxation			     97 vs 98</p>
<p>Profit after taxation	   290 vs 296</p>
<p>($1=83.5 naira)</p>
</text>
